$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General Procedure for the Synthesis of 7 To a
stirred mixture of Pd(PPh3)4 (0.005 mmol), Na2CO3 (0.1 mmol), 4a (0.1
mmol), phenylboronic acid (0.13 mmol) under N2 atomosphere was added the
solvent of DMF/ H2O (4 mL, 2:1) via syringe at room temperature. The
reaction mixture was stirred for about 12 hours at 90 oC. After cooled,
the mixture was washed with H2O, extracted with AcOEt, dried over Na2SO4,
then filtered and concentrated. The residue was purified by column
chromatography over silica gel with hexane/ AcOEt as the eluent. 7.
2-methyl-2',3'-diphenyl-2H-spiro[benzo[d]isothiazole-3,1'-indene]
1,1-dioxide (7a)
2'-(4-fluorophenyl)-2-methyl-3'-phenyl-2H-spiro[benzo[d]isothiazole-3,1'-indene]
1,1-dioxide (7c) Yield: 95%; pale yellow solid. M.p. 238-240 °C; 1H NMR
(400 MHz, CDCl3): δ 7.90 (d, J = 7.6 Hz, 1H), 7.55-7.27 (m, 10H), 7.20
(t, J = 7.0 Hz, 1H), 7.10 (d, J = 7.6 Hz, 1H), 6.96-6.88 (m, 2H), 6.74
(t, J = 8.6 Hz, 2H), 2.60 (s, 3H) ppm; 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3): δ 162.3
(d, 1 J CF = 247 Hz), 145.1, 143.6, 143.0, 140.1, 137.8, 135.2, 134.0,
133.6, 130.8 (d, 3 J CF = 8 Hz), 129.9, 129.6, 129.5, 129.22, 129.17,
128.7, 127.7, 124.1, 123.4, 122.0, 121.8, 115.5 (d, 2 J CF = 21 Hz),
78.6, 24.3 ppm; IR (film): 3064, 2931, 1599, 1508, 1300, 1232, 1205,
1167, 1128, 1059 cm-1; HRMS (EI) m/z calcd for C28H20FNO2S: 453.1199;
found: 453.1190.
